        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your epic adventure begins... at the bottom of your screen (BoYS).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Heroes</strong> is a unique idle RPG designed to be your faithful companion while you work. Set just above your taskbar, this unobtrusive game runs in the background, letting you build a team of courageous heroes, battle monstrous foes, and collect loot; all without disrupting your productivity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fantasy World on Your Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you type emails, write code, or browse spreadsheets, your party of four customizable heroes embarks on quests, defeats enemies, and gathers treasures in real-time. Watch your hero grow stronger while you focus on your daily tasks, or jump in to support when you're ready for a quick break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/90eff9ba44e2b1663abd66ea35fd34fb.webp?t=1773932855\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/90eff9ba44e2b1663abd66ea35fd34fb.poster.avif?t=1773932855\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=409 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙‍♂️ <strong>Four Iconic Classes</strong>: Lead a balanced party of a spell-slinging Wizard, a sword-wielding Warrior, a precise Hunter, and a stealthy Assassin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Idle Gameplay, Active Rewards</strong>: Play passively or jump in anytime to claim rewards, upgrade gear, and make strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Work-Friendly Design</strong>: Runs quietly at the bottom of your screen. No pop-ups, no distractions... just progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Expanding Adventures</strong>: Unlock new regions, fight powerful bosses, and uncover secrets, even while answering emails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Charming Pixel Art Style</strong>: A light and appealing visual design that complements your workspace, not competes with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're grinding through your to-do list or taking a five-minute coffee break, <strong>Desktop Heroes</strong> keeps the adventure going, one pixel-sized battle at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/4463f24d1f752f88da89f96e2ed0dcae.poster.avif?t=1773932855\" width=780 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/4463f24d1f752f88da89f96e2ed0dcae.webm?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/4463f24d1f752f88da89f96e2ed0dcae.mp4?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Desktop Heroes' special <strong>Protect Mode</strong>, even if you share your entire screen during a meeting while playing a game, the people on the other end won't be able to see that you're playing. 😉</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Virtual Mode</strong>, if you need to click on an area behind the game at the bottom of your screen, you can continue working without having to close the game. And it's easy to read text behind the game or click on something!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/de9b79111a36228f12c0411afb5eca74.poster.avif?t=1773932855\" width=770 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/de9b79111a36228f12c0411afb5eca74.webm?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/de9b79111a36228f12c0411afb5eca74.mp4?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your epic adventure begins... at the bottom of your screen (BoYS).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Heroes</strong> is a unique idle RPG designed to be your faithful companion while you work. Set just above your taskbar, this unobtrusive game runs in the background, letting you build a team of courageous heroes, battle monstrous foes, and collect loot; all without disrupting your productivity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fantasy World on Your Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you type emails, write code, or browse spreadsheets, your party of four customizable heroes embarks on quests, defeats enemies, and gathers treasures in real-time. Watch your hero grow stronger while you focus on your daily tasks, or jump in to support when you're ready for a quick break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/90eff9ba44e2b1663abd66ea35fd34fb.webp?t=1773932855\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/90eff9ba44e2b1663abd66ea35fd34fb.poster.avif?t=1773932855\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=409 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙‍♂️ <strong>Four Iconic Classes</strong>: Lead a balanced party of a spell-slinging Wizard, a sword-wielding Warrior, a precise Hunter, and a stealthy Assassin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Idle Gameplay, Active Rewards</strong>: Play passively or jump in anytime to claim rewards, upgrade gear, and make strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Work-Friendly Design</strong>: Runs quietly at the bottom of your screen. No pop-ups, no distractions... just progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Expanding Adventures</strong>: Unlock new regions, fight powerful bosses, and uncover secrets, even while answering emails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Charming Pixel Art Style</strong>: A light and appealing visual design that complements your workspace, not competes with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're grinding through your to-do list or taking a five-minute coffee break, <strong>Desktop Heroes</strong> keeps the adventure going, one pixel-sized battle at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/4463f24d1f752f88da89f96e2ed0dcae.poster.avif?t=1773932855\" width=780 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/4463f24d1f752f88da89f96e2ed0dcae.webm?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/4463f24d1f752f88da89f96e2ed0dcae.mp4?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Desktop Heroes' special <strong>Protect Mode</strong>, even if you share your entire screen during a meeting while playing a game, the people on the other end won't be able to see that you're playing. 😉</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Virtual Mode</strong>, if you need to click on an area behind the game at the bottom of your screen, you can continue working without having to close the game. And it's easy to read text behind the game or click on something!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/de9b79111a36228f12c0411afb5eca74.poster.avif?t=1773932855\" width=770 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/de9b79111a36228f12c0411afb5eca74.webm?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734200/extras/de9b79111a36228f12c0411afb5eca74.mp4?t=1773932855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
